            .section-desc
                p.desc
                    .text(class="body-1 text-Utility-gray-950 font-primary")
                        span(class="text-Utility-gray-950 font-bold") Bel Ga Asia 
                        | is a joint venture between Yellow Bird (a family-owned hatchery group including its own breeder activities originating from Belgium) and De Heus Animal Nutrition (A leading top-10 player in high quality animal nutrition). Established over 14 years ago, Bel Ga Asia has grown into a leading poultry company specializing in the production of high-quality day-old chicks and day-old layers for independent poultry farmers across Asia. Built on international standards, Bel Ga Asia combines technical expertise, innovation, and sustainable business practices to produce high-quality Day-Old Chicks and Day-Old Layers. Today, Bel Ga Asia operates through three companies: Bel Ga Vietnam, Bel Ga Myanmar and Bel Ga Cambodia, serving customers throughout Asia with a shared commitment to quality, reliability, and continuous improvement.
